rate: $40-$58/hour</strong>: Covers both direct sessions and documentation time.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Schedule and flexibility:</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Design your own schedule around your needs and lifestyle. Our clients typically seek services after 3:30pm weekdays and early mornings/afternoons on weekends. A minimum of 7 hours of total availability per week is required.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Why SLPs choose Expressable:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI-assisted documentation: </strong>Our clinician-built AI assistant, Scout, dramatically cuts documentation time and admin tasks</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Part-time benefit eligibility</strong>: 401(k) matching, sick time, Employee Assistance Program</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities: </strong>Expressable has ample opportunities for professional development and positions to grow your career</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Tons of free resources</strong>: ASHA-approved CEUs, library of home programs and exercises, free subscription to Super Duper, and much more</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Company-provided hardware:</strong> A new Macbook + iPad for clinical care</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dedicated support teams: </strong>Specialized team for patient insurance, billing, authorizations, and more so you can focus on care</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Vibrant community 250+ strong: </strong>Join a collaborative team of SLPs committed to transforming speech therapy</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐What you’ll do:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide remote speech therapy sessions/evaluations for a diverse pediatric population</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Diagnose and develop care plans using Expressable’s clinical tools and platform</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deliver outcomes-focused care with an emphasis on caregiver engagement</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete all documentation accurately and on time</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Participate in required training and team communication</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide coverage for PTO and sick leave to ensure care continuity</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Requirements:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">CCC-SLP (ASHA Certificate of Clinical Competence) and individual NPI number</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Licensed in a key state (or willingness to obtain prior to start date)</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Reliable internet connection and comfort with teletherapy platforms</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Minimum 1 year of post-CF experience in pediatric settings</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong computer literacy and ability to learn new systems independently</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with insurance-based or Medicaid populations</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-VZ1</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#ZR</p>","descriptionPlain":"100% remote | W2 employment | $40 - $58/hour | Flexible Scheduling\n\n(It is required to hold a state license in NJ STATE, or be open to obtaining that state license.)\n\nWelcome to Expressable! We’re an SLP-founded company on a mission to expand access to family-led online speech therapy. We believe in empowering caregivers to be active participants in their loved one’s communication journey, and are proud to be certified by The Joint Commission and backed by 3,500+ 5-star reviews.\n\n⭐ Compensation:\n\nThis is a non-exempt, W2 hourly position.\n\n - Clinical rate: $40-$58/hour: Covers both direct sessions and documentation time.\n\n⭐ Schedule and flexibility:\n\nDesign your own schedule around your needs and lifestyle. Our clients typically seek services after 3:30pm weekdays and early mornings/afternoons on weekends. A minimum of 7 hours of total availability per week is required.\n\n\n\nWhy SLPs choose Expressable:\n\n - AI-assisted documentation: Our clinician-built AI assistant, Scout, dramatically cuts documentation time and admin tasks\n\n - Part-time benefit eligibility: 401(k) matching, sick time, Employee Assistance Program\n\n - Growth opportunities: Expressable has ample opportunities for professional development and positions to grow your career\n\n - Tons of free resources: ASHA-approved CEUs, library of home programs and exercises, free subscription to Super Duper, and much more\n\n - Company-provided hardware: A new Macbook + iPad for clinical care\n\n - Dedicated support teams: Specialized team for patient insurance, billing, authorizations, and more so you can focus on care\n\n - Vibrant community 250+ strong: Join a collaborative team of SLPs committed to transforming speech therapy\n\n⭐What you’ll do:\n\n - Provide remote speech therapy sessions/evaluations for a diverse pediatric population\n\n - Diagnose and develop care plans using Expressable’s clinical tools and platform\n\n - Deliver outcomes-focused care with an emphasis on caregiver engagement\n\n - Complete all documentation accurately and on time\n\n - Participate in required training and team communication\n\n - Provide coverage for PTO and sick leave to ensure care continuity\n\n⭐ Requirements:\n\n - CCC-SLP (ASHA Certificate of Clinical Competence) and individual NPI number\n\n - Licensed in a key state (or willingness to obtain prior to start date)\n\n - Reliable internet connection and comfort with teletherapy platforms\n\n - Minimum 1 year of post-CF experience in pediatric settings\n\n - Strong computer literacy and ability to learn new systems independently\n\n - Familiarity with insurance-based or Medicaid populations\n\n\n\n#LI-VZ1\n\n#ZR","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$40 – $54 per hour","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[{"id":"df1533f0-0266-44c5-b31c-e2aefcdd1668","tierSummary":"$40 – $54 per hour","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"9db36e37-5411-4784-82f2-19bada74bb62","summary":"$40 – $54 per hour","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 HOUR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":40,"maxValue":54}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 HOUR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":40,"maxValue":54}]}},{"id":"edd9949c-cf92-4ad3-8bdf-1f592b891d0d","title":"Speech-Language Pathologist","department":"Hourly Part-Time (Clinical)","team":"Hourly Part-Time (Clinical)","employmentType":"PartTime","location":"Colorado","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-07-23T17:58:56.619+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"Colorado","addressCountry":"USA","addressLocality":"Denver"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/expressable/edd9949c-cf92-4ad3-8bdf-1f592b891d0d","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/expressable/edd9949c-cf92-4ad3-8bdf-1f592b891d0d/application","descriptionHtml":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>100% remote | W2 employment | $40 - $56/hour | Flexible Scheduling</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>(It is required to hold a state license in CO STATE, or be open to obtaining that state license.)</em></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Welcome to Expressable! We’re an SLP-founded company on a mission to expand access to family-led online speech therapy. We believe in empowering caregivers to be active participants in their loved one’s communication journey, and are proud to be certified by The Joint Commission and backed by 3,500+ 5-star reviews.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">⭐ <strong>Compensation<