dicaid populations</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-VZ1</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#ZR</p>","descriptionPlain":"100% remote  |  W2 employment  |  $40 - $54/hour |  Flexible Scheduling\n\n(It is required to hold a state license in Georgia and be located within Georgia).\n\nWelcome to Expressable! We’re an SLP-founded company on a mission to expand access to family-led online speech therapy. We believe in empowering caregivers to be active participants in their loved one’s communication journey, and are proud to be certified by The Joint Commission and backed by 3,500+ 5-star reviews.\n\n⭐ Compensation:\nThis is a non-exempt, W2 hourly position.\n\n - Clinical rate: $40-$54/hour: Covers both direct sessions and documentation time.\n\n⭐ Schedule and flexibility:\nDesign your own schedule around your needs and lifestyle. Our clients typically seek services after 3:30pm weekdays and early mornings/afternoons on weekends. A minimum of 7 hours of total availability per week is required.\n\n\n\nWhy SLPs choose Expressable:\n\n - AI-assisted documentation: Our clinician-built AI assistant, Scout, dramatically cuts documentation time and admin tasks\n\n - Part-time benefit eligibility: 401(k) matching, sick time, Employee Assistance Program\n\n - Growth opportunities: Expressable has ample opportunities for professional development and positions to grow your career\n\n - Tons of free resources: ASHA-approved CEUs, library of home programs and exercises, free subscription to Super Duper, and much more\n\n - Company-provided hardware: A new Macbook + iPad for clinical care\n\n - Dedicated support teams: Specialized team for patient insurance, billing, authorizations, and more so you can focus on care\n\n - Vibrant community 250+ strong: Join a collaborative team of SLPs committed to transforming speech therapy\n\n⭐What you’ll do:\n\n - Provide remote speech therapy sessions/evaluations for a diverse pediatric population\n\n - Diagnose and develop care plans using Expressable’s clinical tools and platform\n\n - Deliver outcomes-focused care with an emphasis on caregiver engagement\n\n - Complete all documentation accurately and on time\n\n - Participate in required training and team communication\n\n - Provide coverage for PTO and sick leave to ensure care continuity\n\n\n\n⭐ Requirements:\n\n - CCC-SLP (ASHA Certificate of Clinical Competence) and individual NPI number\n\n - Licensed in a key state (or willingness to obtain prior to start date)\n\n - Reliable internet connection and comfort with teletherapy platforms\n\n - Minimum 1 year of post-CF experience in pediatric settings\n\n - Strong computer literacy and ability to learn new systems independently\n\n - Familiarity with insurance-based or Medicaid populations\n\n\n\n#LI-VZ1\n\n#ZR","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$40 – $54 per hour","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[{"id":"68c344c9-8634-4e4f-afb1-c4c65bdca2de","tierSummary":"$40 – $54 per hour","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"6c989d27-dcd8-4411-bca7-b037193c9a94","summary":"$40 – $54 per hour","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 HOUR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":40,"maxValue":54}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 HOUR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":40,"maxValue":54}]}},{"id":"e4993c18-ebce-41d3-87a3-b635591de487","title":"Speech-Language Pathologist","department":"Full-time Salaried (Clinical)","team":"Full-time Salaried (Clinical)","employmentType":"FullTime","location":"Georgia","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-09-03T18:08:14.187+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"Georgia","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"Atlanta"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/expressable/e4993c18-ebce-41d3-87a3-b635591de487","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/expressable/e4993c18-ebce-41d3-87a3-b635591de487/application","descriptionHtml":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>100% remote | W2 employment | Full-Time, Part-Time | Flexible Schedule Options</strong></em></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>(It is required to hold a state license in Georgia and be located within Georgia).</em></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Welcome to Expressable! We’re an SLP-founded company on a mission to expand access to family-led online speech therapy. We believe in empowering caregivers to be active participants in their loved one’s communication journey, and are proud to be certified by The Joint Commission and backed by 3,500+ 5-star reviews.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Choose the schedule that fits your life</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Whether you’re looking for maximum flexibility, a consistent part-time caseload, or full-time hours, we offer multiple ways to build a schedule that fits your lifestyle and grow your career.</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Part-Time Hourly — for SLPs that want part-time consistency:</strong> requires a minimum of 7 hours per week, allowing you to build your own caseload and develop ongoing relationships with families. </p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Full-Time Salary (Exempt) — for SLPs that was a consistent caseload</strong>: your choice of a 30-, 32-, 36-, 38-,or 40-hour schedule, a dedicated caseload, and comprehensive benefits with recurring scheduling earnings opportunities.<br /></p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Compensation: All Expressable clinicians are W2 employees.</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Compensation is determined based on experience, licensure, market considerations, and high-demand availability (weekends and after 3:30pm on weekdays)</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><u>Part-Time Hourly</u></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Clinical Rate: $40-$54/hour. Covers both direct sessions &amp; documentation time</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><u>Full-Time Salary (Exempt)</u></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Annualized compensation between $67,000-$94,000. The more high demand hours you work, the higher your compensation.</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Why SLPs choose Expressable:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">AI-assisted documentation: Our clinician-built AI assistant, Scout, dramatically cuts documentation time and admin tasks</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Part-time benefit eligibility: 401(k) matching, sick time, Employee Assistance Program</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Full-time benefit eligibility: 401(k) matching, medical, dental, and vision insurance, accrued PTO and sick time, paid Winter Break &amp; company holidays, Employee Assistance Program</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Growth opportunities: Expressable has ample opportunities for professional development and positions to grow your career</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Tons of free resources: ASHA-approved CEUs, library of home programs and exercises, free subscription to Super Duper, and much more</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Company-provided hardware: A new Macbook + iPad for clinical care</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Dedicated support teams: Specialized team for patient insurance, billing, authorizations, and more so you can focus on care</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Vibrant community 250+ strong: Join a collaborative team of SLPs committed to transforming speech therapy</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐What you’ll do:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide remote speech therapy sessions/evaluations for a diverse pediatric population</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Diagnose and develop care plans using Expressable’s clinical tools and platform</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deliver outcomes-focused care with an emphasis on caregiver engagement</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete all documentation accurately and on time</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Participate in required training and team communication</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide coverage for PTO and sick leave to ensure care continuity</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Requirements:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">CCC-SLP (ASHA Certificate of Clinical Competence) and individual NPI number</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Licensed in a key state (or willingness to obtain prior to start date)</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Reliable internet connection and comfort with teletherapy platforms</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Minimum 1 year of post-CF experience in pediatric settings</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong computer literacy and ability to learn new systems independently</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with insurance-based or Medicaid populations</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-VZ1</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#ZR</p>","descriptionPlain":"100% remote | W2 employment | Full-Time, Part-Time | Flexible Schedule Options\n\n(It is required to hold a state license in Georgia and be located within Georgia).\n\n\n\nWelcome to Expressable! We’re an SLP-founded company on a mission to expand access to family-led online speech therapy. We believe in empowering caregivers to be active participants in their loved one’s communication journey, and are proud to be certified by The Joint Commission and backed by 3,500+ 5-star reviews.\n\n\n\n⭐ Choose the schedule that fits your life\n\nWhether you’re looking for maximum flexibility, a consistent part-time caseload, or full-time hours, we offer multiple ways to build a schedule that fits your lifestyle and grow your career.\n\n - Part-Time Hourly — for SLPs that want part-time consistency: requires a minimum of 7 hours per week, allowing you to build your own caseload and develop ongoing relationships with families. \n\n - Full-Time Salary (Exempt) — for SLPs that was a consistent caseload: your choice of a 30-, 32-, 36-, 38-,or 40-hour schedule, a dedicated caseload, and comprehensive benefits with recurring scheduling earnings opportunities.\n   \n\n⭐ Compensation: All Expressable clinicians are W2 employees.\n\nCompensation is determined based on experience, licensure, market considerations, and high-demand availability (weekends and after 3:30pm on weekdays)\n\nPart-Time Hourly\n\n - Clinical Rate: $40-$54/hour. Covers both direct sessions & documentation time\n\nFull-Time Salary (Exempt)\n\n - Annualized compensation between $67,000-$94,000. The more high demand hours you work, the higher your compensation.\n\n\n\n⭐ Why SLPs choose Expressable:\n\n - AI-assisted documentation: Our clinician-built AI assistant, Scout, dramatically cuts documentation time and admin tasks\n\n - Part-time benefit eligibility: 401(k) matching, sick time, Employee Assistance Program\n\n - Full-time benefit eligibility: 401(k) matching, medical, dental, and vision insurance, accrued PTO and sick time, paid Winter Break & company holidays, Employee Assistance Program\n\n - Growth opportunities: Expressable has ample opportunities for professional development and positions to grow your career\n\n - Tons of free resources: ASHA-approved CEUs, library of home programs and exercises, free subscription to Super Duper, and much more\n\n - Company-provided hardware: A new Macbook + iPad for clinical care\n\n - Dedicated support teams: Specialized team for patient insurance, billing, authorizations, and more so you can focus on care\n\n - Vibrant community 250+ strong: Join a collaborative team of SLPs committed to transforming speech therapy\n\n\n\n⭐What you’ll do:\n\n - Provide remote speech therapy sessions/evaluations for a diverse pediatric population\n\n - Diagnose and develop care plans using Expressable’s clinical tools and platform\n\n - Deliver outcomes-focused care with an emphasis on caregiver engagement\n\n - Complete all documentation accurately and on time\n\n - Participate in required training and team communication\n\n - Provide coverage for PTO and sick leave to ensure care continuity\n\n\n\n⭐ Requirements:\n\n - CCC-SLP (ASHA Certificate of Clinical Competence) and individual NPI number\n\n - Licensed in a key state (or willingness to obtain prior to start date)\n\n - Reliable internet connection and comfort with teletherapy platforms\n\n - Minimum 1 year of post-CF experience in pediatric settings\n\n - Strong computer literacy and ability to learn new systems independently\n\n - Familiarity with insurance-based or Medicaid populations\n   \n   \n\n#LI-VZ1\n\n#ZR","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$63K – $81K","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":"$63K - $81K","compensationTiers":[{"id":"9dea7b4b-7f7c-49bb-828e-7eb558591351","tierSummary":"$63K – $81K","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"58af3f74-f47b-4c81-bb8b-12d1da97c34f","summary":"$63K – $81K","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":63000,"maxValue":81000}]}],"summaryComponents":[{"compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 YEAR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":63000,"maxValue":81000}]}},{"id":"9927ff33-3f62-4893-84b1-e82b2e33deed","title":"Occupational Therapist","department":"Clinical-OT","team":"Clinical-OT","employmentType":"PartTime","location":"Texas","shouldDisplayCompensationOnJobPostings":true,"secondaryLocations":[],"publishedAt":"2026-09-03T18:58:40.237+00:00","isListed":true,"isRemote":true,"workplaceType":"Remote","address":{"postalAddress":{"addressRegion":"Texas","addressCountry":"United States","addressLocality":"Dallas"}},"jobUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/expressable/9927ff33-3f62-4893-84b1-e82b2e33deed","applyUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/expressable/9927ff33-3f62-4893-84b1-e82b2e33deed/application","descriptionHtml":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em><strong>W2 employment  |  $40 - $54/hour |  Flexible Scheduling</strong></em></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>(This role is primarily remote; however, hybrid opportunities may be available in certain markets. Candidates must hold a Texas state license and ideally be located within Texas.)</em></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Welcome to Expressable! We’re an SLP-founded company on a mission to expand access to family-led online therapy. We believe in empowering caregivers to be active participants in their loved one’s communication journey, and are proud to be backed by 3,500+ 5-star reviews.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">⭐ <strong>Compensation:<br /></strong>This is a non-exempt, W2 hourly position.</p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Clinical rate: $40-$54/hour:</strong> Covers both direct sessions and documentation time.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Schedule and flexibility: </strong><br />Design your own schedule around your needs and lifestyle. Our clients typically seek services after 3:30pm weekdays and early mornings/afternoons on weekends. A minimum of 7 hours of total availability per week is required.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Why OTs choose Expressable:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>AI-assisted documentation:</strong> Our clinician-built AI assistant, Scout, dramatically cuts documentation time and admin tasks</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Part-time benefit eligibility:</strong> 401(k) matching, sick time, Employee Assistance Program</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Growth opportunities:</strong> Expressable has ample opportunities for professional development and positions to grow your career</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Tons of free resources:</strong> Approved CEUs, library of home programs and exercises, access to virtual materials, and much more</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Company-provided hardware: </strong>A new Macbook + iPad for clinical care</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Dedicated support teams:</strong> Specialized team for patient insurance, billing, authorizations, and more so you can focus on care</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Vibrant community 250+ strong:</strong> Join a collaborative team of clinicians committed to transforming speech therapy</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐What you’ll do:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide remote occupational therapy sessions/evaluations for a diverse pediatric population</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Diagnose and develop care plans using Expressable’s clinical tools and platform</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Deliver outcomes-focused care with an emphasis on caregiver engagement</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Complete all documentation accurately and on time</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Participate in required training and team communication</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Provide coverage for PTO and sick leave to ensure care continuity</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>⭐ Requirements:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Master’s or Doctorate degree in Occupational Therapy (MOT, OTD, or equivalent) and individual NPI number</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Licensed in a key state (or willingness to obtain prior to start date)</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Reliable internet connection and comfort with teletherapy platforms</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Minimum 2 years of post-graduate experience in pediatric settings</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong computer literacy and ability to learn new systems independently</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Familiarity with insurance-based or Medicaid populations</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#LI-VZ1</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">#ZR</p>","descriptionPlain":"W2 employment  |  $40 - $54/hour |  Flexible Scheduling\n\n(This role is primarily remote; however, hybrid opportunities may be available in certain markets. Candidates must hold a Texas state license and ideally be located within Texas.)\n\nWelcome to Expressable! We’re an SLP-founded company on a mission to expand access to family-led online therapy. We believe in empowering caregivers to be active participants in their loved one’s communication journey, and are proud to be backed by 3,500+ 5-star reviews.\n\n⭐ Compensation:\nThis is a non-exempt, W2 hourly position.\n\n - Clinical rate: $40-$54/hour: Covers both direct sessions and documentation time.\n   \n   \n\n⭐ Schedule and flexibility: \nDesign your own schedule around your needs and lifestyle. Our clients typically seek services after 3:30pm weekdays and early mornings/afternoons on weekends. A minimum of 7 hours of total availability per week is required.\n\n\n\n⭐ Why OTs choose Expressable:\n\n - AI-assisted documentation: Our clinician-built AI assistant, Scout, dramatically cuts documentation time and admin tasks\n\n - Part-time benefit eligibility: 401(k) matching, sick time, Employee Assistance Program\n\n - Growth opportunities: Expressable has ample opportunities for professional development and positions to grow your career\n\n - Tons of free resources: Approved CEUs, library of home programs and exercises, access to virtual materials, and much more\n\n - Company-provided hardware: A new Macbook + iPad for clinical care\n\n - Dedicated support teams: Specialized team for patient insurance, billing, authorizations, and more so you can focus on care\n\n - Vibrant community 250+ strong: Join a collaborative team of clinicians committed to transforming speech therapy\n   \n   \n\n⭐What you’ll do:\n\n - Provide remote occupational therapy sessions/evaluations for a diverse pediatric population\n\n - Diagnose and develop care plans using Expressable’s clinical tools and platform\n\n - Deliver outcomes-focused care with an emphasis on caregiver engagement\n\n - Complete all documentation accurately and on time\n\n - Participate in required training and team communication\n\n - Provide coverage for PTO and sick leave to ensure care continuity\n\n\n\n⭐ Requirements:\n\n - Master’s or Doctorate degree in Occupational Therapy (MOT, OTD, or equivalent) and individual NPI number\n\n - Licensed in a key state (or willingness to obtain prior to start date)\n\n - Reliable internet connection and comfort with teletherapy platforms\n\n - Minimum 2 years of post-graduate experience in pediatric settings\n\n - Strong computer literacy and ability to learn new systems independently\n\n - Familiarity with insurance-based or Medicaid populations\n\n\n\n#LI-VZ1\n\n#ZR","compensation":{"compensationTierSummary":"$40 – $54 per hour","scrapeableCompensationSalarySummary":null,"compensationTiers":[{"id":"1c10e32c-8e86-4f85-9616-bd1e9497bed8","tierSummary":"$40 – $54 per hour","title":null,"additionalInformation":null,"components":[{"id":"a4831b94-3107-4146-b257-eabcfdb3c691","summary":"$40 – $54 per hour","compensationType":"Salary","interval":"1 HOUR","currencyCode":"USD","minValue":40,"maxValue":